   "urlMobile": "",
   "thumbUrl": "https://d1xhvexl2i3ere.cloudfront.net/makeree/res/2b75eb1b-ce04-4447-ad27-58750ee720e3_thumb.jpg",
   "text": "The previous code would probably not work here, due to the number 700 being too high or too low. \nIn theory, we could changed the threshold value every time we reposition the sensor, but that is just no fun! Instead, we will now code something called Dynamic Calibration, remembering the sensor reading at program start and comparing updated sensor readings to that initial value.",
