   "urlMobile": "",
   "thumbUrl": "https://d1xhvexl2i3ere.cloudfront.net/makeree/res/06d05785-ffd0-4aa0-a43b-673fd9dfc0f7_thumb.jpg",
   "text": "First thing we need to do is replace he loop block with a program block that will allow us to code one-time initializations, placed inside the 'setup' socket",
