   "stepGroup": "Dynamic Calibration",
   "stepGroupId": 4
  },
  {
   "stepId": 31,
   "url": "https://d1xhvexl2i3ere.cloudfront.net/makeree/res/56e6208c-e8e0-45b4-a8c5-c6a5c2b789a5.jpg",
   "urlTablet": "",
   "urlMobile": "",
   "thumbUrl": "https://d1xhvexl2i3ere.cloudfront.net/makeree/res/56e6208c-e8e0-45b4-a8c5-c6a5c2b789a5_thumb.jpg",
   "text": "Next, get a 'set integer variable' block from the Variables drawer and place it in the setup socket. This block will allow us to save the initial sensor value in memory.",
