   "thumbUrl": "https://d1xhvexl2i3ere.cloudfront.net/makeree/res/078e4cdb-a342-4421-be52-24c493f91fea_thumb.jpg",
   "text": "This time, we want to compare the sensor reading against a relative threshold, so get a minus block from the Operators drawer",
