   "text": "...and substract the previously recorded baseline value from the current sensor reading. Do you understand what we just did? Instead of having a fixed threshold, our code now can adapt to different setup environments!",
   "title": "",
   "addToBackground": false,
   "muted": false,
   "autoPlay": false,
   "isGalleryStep": false,
